P4. Preference resolution at const time
=======================================

The cost model, resolved now at runtime for reporting only. The
emitted code resolved it at compile time; see the asm comparison.

  arm                time  space  error   
  wrap                  1      1      9
  saturate              3      1      4
  widen                 7      3      0

  prefer time      weights [8, 1, 1] -> wrap      [wrap=18  saturate=29  widen=59]
  prefer space     weights [1, 8, 1] -> saturate  [wrap=18  saturate=15  widen=31]
  prefer accuracy  weights [1, 1, 8] -> widen     [wrap=74  saturate=36  widen=10]

Three preferences, three different arms, from one table. The
preference is the whole content of the strategy at this layer, and
the arm is derived rather than named.

  direct_wrap    = 532
  pref_speed     = 532   same as direct_wrap: true
  direct_widen   = 1950228
  pref_accuracy  = 1950228   same as direct_widen: true
